# Dorr Android Standards

Read `docs/modules/android/README.md` first. API base: `/api/mobile/v1/*` (guard `user_api`).

- Endpoints only from documented backend routes; add them in `network/*Api.kt` + `ApiModels.kt`
- Every UI string in **both** `values/strings.xml` and `values-ar/strings.xml`
- Colors and font from appearance tokens (`Ch.palette`, `AppFont`), no hard-coded brand colors
- Fields use `DorrTextField` / chat `ChField`
- Do not commit `.gradle/` or `build/` output
- Verify with `./gradlew assembleDebug` from `androidApp/`
